{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:53149274e24f3fbd","name":"Shadow Crown","source":{"id":"source:reference-53149274e24f3fbd","title":"Shadow Crown","revision":21436,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:47:53Z","sha256":"be8b84682529101e6200f9c0ac772f7b03c600cfa0a41495c7797e4b13ed947e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21436","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Shadow%20Crown&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-53149274e24f3fbd","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Shadow Crown is a smokestone circlet that enables a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sorcerer of Rhand"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sorcerer_of_Rhand","referenceId":"reference:ebb239cc6c904b74"}," to communicate with and command its Pawns (which have been imprinted with smokestone) by enhancing the Sorcerer's telepathic abilities. The wearer of the crown must have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"}," feat.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", the wearer can receive sensory information from any or all of its Pawns, gaining a +2 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks for every Pawn within 12 squares or within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," (maximum bonus of +10). The wearer can also issue a one-word emotive command to any or all of its Pawns.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
